#@troubleshoot
##Application failure
1) Check the resources names
2) Check the target-ports
3)Check the endpoints
4)Check the environment varaibles
5)Check the NodePort

##controlplane failure
1) describe the component
2)check the log of the component
3) cheack the yaml of the component
4) one layer deeper docker ps
5) docker logs <containerId>

##workernode failure (In worker node-> /etc/kubernetes/kubelet.conf)
wnode01 is in NotReadyState
1) ssh wnode01
2) service docker status
3) service kubelet status
4) journalctl -u kubelet
5) service kubelet restart
6) one layer deeper docker ps
7) docker logs <containerId>


